title: Ruby
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1 && $hasUnpacked == false>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 1 && $hasUnpacked == true>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day1_afterUnpacking>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day2>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ruby_Day1
---
Ruby: Hey Ernest! I just finished unpacking my bag, you should do the same before exploring the camp!
===

title: Ruby_Day1_afterUnpacking
---
Ruby: Have you checked out the camp? You should go explore!
===

title: Ruby_Day2
---
Ruby: Good morning Ernest! Have you seen Talia's game of cards yet? You should go check it out! 
